{"id":"44cb62239daefca4","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Identity.md","title":"Identity","display":"Identity","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"Identity","parameters":["A","f"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"Identity"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>A</span><span>f</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：小拟范畴语义。有序参数：<code>A</code>、<code>f</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ Identity A f)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and (@ FunDom f A) (forall x (implies (in x A) (@ App f x x))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2fa14e4bd3447c97\" href=\"?note=2fa14e4bd3447c97\" title=\"ZFC_FunDom\">FunDom</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ Identity A f)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FunDom","status":"resolved","id":"2fa14e4bd3447c97","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":776,"backlinks":[{"id":"f8f4015d1e8911d1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Identity|Identity]]"},{"id":"85c9ab4a34ec968f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Compose|Compose]]；[[ZFC_DeltaArrow|DeltaArrow]]；[[ZFC_DeltaKey|DeltaKey]]；[[ZFC_Dom|Dom]]；[[ZFC_Fun|Fun]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_Identity|Identity]]；[[ZFC_Map|Map]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_SimpRestriction|SimpRestriction]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-705","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_Identity|Identity]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","8bd25e131370b9c4","2fa14e4bd3447c97","593f9bdab4d60707"]}